# quest/034/LucKze103_03458 — « In Father's Footsteps» · in play order
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: ru\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"X-Game-Version: 2026.09.15.0000.0000\n"
"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>特殊ルール： レベルアジャスト</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>ジョッブ砦のカレアは困っているようだ。
#. de: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> Schwierigkeitsanpassung</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Callea ist in großer Unruhe.
#. fr: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Règle spéciale<nbsp>:  synchronisation de quête</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Callea semble très préoccupée.
#. kind: journal
#. macro: <ui-color 508> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 508 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 509> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 509 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze103_03458:TEXT_LUCKZE103_03458_SEQ_00:1"
msgid "<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> Quest Sync</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Callea wears an expression of grave concern."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ※本クエストには「<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509></ui-edge-color></ui-color> レベルアジャスト」が、<br>　設定されています。<br><br>罪喰いに襲われた兵士のため、血清を作ることになった。材料を集めるため、レイクランドの迷える羊飼いの森で「カレア」と話そう。
#. de: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509></ui-edge-color></ui-color> Die Schwierigkeit des Auftrags wird an die aktuelle Stufe angepasst.<br><br>Callea will ein Serum herstellen, um einen vergifteten Soldaten zu retten. Dazu braucht sie einen Wirkstoff, den ihr im Wald des Verirrten Hirten auftreiben wollt. Sprich dort wieder mit Callea.
#. fr: * <i>Cette quête est <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> synchronisée</ui-edge-color></ui-color> avec votre niveau.</i><br><br>Callea vous a appris qu'un blessé avait été amené au fort en votre absence. Il s'agirait d'un soldat qui a été attaqué par un triffide violet. Le poison de la créature étant très virulent, la jeune femme et Nielden vous ont expliqué qu'il était impossible de déplacer davantage cet homme, et que son seul espoir était de préparer un sérum. Hélas, pour cela, il est nécessaire d'avoir un échantillon frais du venin. Callea vous a donc demandé de l'accompagner dans la forêt située à l'ouest afin de piéger une de ces créatures et en prélever la précieuse substance.
#. kind: journal
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze103_03458:TEXT_LUCKZE103_03458_SEQ_01:1"
msgid "Callea shares with you the incident that has been weighing on her mind. It would seem that while you were making arrangements for her lodgings at the Crystarium, a young soldier was carried to the infirmary in dire condition, suffering from a most virulent poison inflicted upon him by a roving beast. Though the girl was able to find a recipe for an antidote in her father's records, she will require a sample of the selfsame poison in order to prepare the medicine. Moved by her resolve and decisiveness, you resolve to accompany the girl to the woods west of the forest and help her procure the venom she needs.<br><br>※Please note that the difficulty of this quest has been synced to your current level."
msgstr ""

#. ja: カレアから血清の材料となる、毒の採取を頼まれた。迷える羊飼いの森にいる「<sheet BNpcName 8502 0>」から、まれに得られる「<sheet EventItem 2002667 0>」を入手しよう。
#. de: Du sollst Callea ein bestimmtes Gift beschaffen. Finde <noun-de BNpcName 1 8502 1 4 1>, überwältige die Kreatur und fange <noun-de EventItem 2 2002667 1 4 1> auf.
#. fr: Une fois près de l'endroit où vivent <noun-fr BNpcName 2 8502 2 1> possédant le fameux venin, Callea vous a demandé d'obtenir <noun-fr EventItem 1 2002667 1 1> sur une de ces créatures.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze103_03458:TEXT_LUCKZE103_03458_SEQ_02:1"
msgid "You arrive in the forest, where Callea once again thanks you for your aid. She provides you with a phial to be used in collecting the sample of venom, as well as a word of warning: the medicine must be mixed while the venom is still fresh, meaning that if you tarry too long, you will have to procure a sample anew. Keeping this in mind, you scour the area in search of one of the ghastly creatures known as violet triffids."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <sheet EventItem 2002667 0>を入手した。迷える羊飼いの森の「カレア」に「<sheet EventItem 2002667 0>」を渡そう。
#. de: Du hast das Gift besorgt. Gib es Callea im Wald des Verirrten Hirten.
#. fr: Vous avez réussi à obtenir <noun-fr EventItem 1 2002667 1 1>. Rapportez-la à Callea.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze103_03458:TEXT_LUCKZE103_03458_SEQ_03:1"
msgid "You were able to procure a suitable sample of venom from a violet triffid. Deliver it to Callea with all speed, that she might mix the antidote while the poison is still fresh."
msgstr ""

#. ja: カレアに<sheet EventItem 2002667 0>を渡した。これで無事に血清が作れそうだ。
#. de: Callea dankt dir und macht sich gleich daran, das Serum herzustellen.
#. fr: La jeune femme s'est réjouie lorsque vous lui avez remis la précieuse substance. Il ne lui reste plus qu'à préparer le sérum salvateur.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze103_03458:TEXT_LUCKZE103_03458_SEQ_04:1"
msgid "You safely and swiftly deliver the venom to Callea, who proclaims it perfect for preparing the antidote that will cure the poor soldier. Watch over and see that she is safe as she performs the task."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 迷える羊飼いの森のカレアと話す
#. de: Im Wald des Verirrten Hirten mit Callea sprechen
#. fr: Parler à Callea, dans la forêt du Berger égaré
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze103_03458:TEXT_LUCKZE103_03458_TODO_00:1"
msgid "Speak with Callea in the Forest of the Lost Shepherd."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <sheet BNpcName 8502 0>からまれに得られる<sheet EventItem 2002667 0>を入手
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de BNpcName 1 8502 1 4 1></capitalize> besiegen und <noun-de EventItem 2 2002667 1 4 1> auffangen
#. fr: Obtenir <noun-fr EventItem 1 2002667 1 1> sur <noun-fr BNpcName 1 8502 1 1>
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze103_03458:TEXT_LUCKZE103_03458_TODO_01:1"
msgid "Obtain poisonous sap from a violet triffid."
msgstr ""

#. ja: カレアに<sheet EventItem 2002667 0>を渡す
#. de: Callea <noun-de EventItem 2 2002667 1 4 1> geben
#. fr: Donner <noun-fr EventItem 2 2002667 1 1> à Callea
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze103_03458:TEXT_LUCKZE103_03458_TODO_02:1"
msgid "Deliver the poisonous sap to Callea."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ちょっと困ったことになってな、<br>詳しくは、カレアから話を聞いてくれ。
#. de: Die Umstände haben sich inzwischen etwas geändert. Callea wird es dir erklären.
#. fr: Nous avons un petit souci, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>. Demande à Callea de t'expliquer de quoi il s'agit.
#. speaker: NIELDEN
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze103_03458:TEXT_LUCKZE103_03458_NIELDEN_100_000:1"
msgid "I fear the news isn't good, friend. Ye'd best hear it from Callea herself."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 実は、<split " " 1><string $gs1></split>さんが、<br>クリスタリウムに行っている間に、急患が運ばれてきたんです。<br>今は、塔の中の診療所で眠っていますが……。
#. de: Während du weg warst, hat man einen Notfallpatienten in die Praxis gebracht. Im Moment schläft er.
#. fr: En fait, pendant que vous étiez parti<if $gn4>e</if> à Cristarium, un homme grièvement blessé a été amené ici. Il est ac<shy>tu<shy>el<shy>le<shy>ment à l'infirmerie, dans la tour.
#. speaker: CALLEA
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze103_03458:TEXT_LUCKZE103_03458_CALLEA_000_000:1"
msgid "My apologies, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>. I fear we have a bit of a situation on our hands. While you were away kindly making arrangements for me at the Crystarium, a young man was rushed here with the most horrific symptoms..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 搬送されてきたのは、この砦の兵士だ。<br>哨戒任務中だったようでな、同行していた兵士によると、<br>はぐれ罪喰いに襲われたらしい。
#. de: Es ist ein Soldat, der hier auf der Festung stationiert war. Sein Kamerad berichtete, dass sie auf ihrer Patrouille von einem Sünden<shy>ver<shy>tilger angegriffen wurden.
#. fr: Il s'agit d'un soldat du fort qui, d'après ses compagnons d'armes, aurait été attaqué par un purgateur esseulé au cours d'une patrouille.
#. speaker: NIELDEN
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze103_03458:TEXT_LUCKZE103_03458_NIELDEN_000_001:1"
msgid "Aye, one of the new recruits here at Fort Jobb. A nasty fiend got him─one o' those damn tree men─an' got him bad. As his brothers-in-arms tell it, he was lucky to survive. Sadly, he won't be survivin' much longer in his current state."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 件の罪喰いが、毒を持った個体だったようでな。<br>すでに、だいぶ毒素が回っているようで、<br>これ以上動かすわけにはいかんのだ。
#. de: Es muss sich um ein giftiges Exemplar gehandelt haben. Das Gift beginnt bereits zu wirken. Einen weiteren Transport sollten wir lieber nicht riskieren.
#. fr: Il a apparemment été empoisonné et se trouve dans un état grave. Nous ne pouvons pas lui imposer davantage de déplacements.
#. speaker: NIELDEN
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze103_03458:TEXT_LUCKZE103_03458_NIELDEN_000_002:1"
msgid "See, the beast that nicked him had some nasty venom in its claws. The way the poor boy's convulsin', it's probably spreadin' through his body even as we speak. He's restin' in bed for now, but if we don't do somethin' soon..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 遺品整理中に、父がこれまで作ってきた、<br>薬の調合方法が書かれた手記を見つけたんです。<br>これを参考にすれば、わたしでも血清は作れるでしょう。
#. de: In der Hinterlassenschaft meines Vaters habe ich ein Rezept für ein Gegengift gefunden. Wenn ich mich genau danach richte, kann ich vielleicht ein Serum herstellen.
#. fr: En cherchant dans les affaires de mon père, j'ai trouvé un livre de pharmacopée, et il y est justement inscrit la composition d'un sérum qui pourrait sauver la vie de ce soldat.
#. speaker: CALLEA
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze103_03458:TEXT_LUCKZE103_03458_CALLEA_000_003:1"
msgid "Searching through Father's belongings, I found a book containing recipes for a wide variety of antidotes. The instructions seem clear enough─I am quite confident I could mix one up provided I had the proper ingredients."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……ですが、血清の調合には、元となる毒が必要です。<br>しかも、その毒は変質しやすいため、<br>採取した直後に、調合を行わなくてはならず……。
#. de: Dazu bräuchte ich einen bestimmten Wirkstoff. Er muss sofort verarbeitet werden, sonst verändern sich seine Eigenschaften. Glücklicherweise gibt es hier in der Nähe <noun-de BNpcName 5 8502 2 4 1>, die diesen Wirkstoff in ihrem Inneren produzieren.
#. fr: L'ennui, c'est qu'il nous faut un peu du venin en question. Cette substance étant très instable, il est nécessaire d'utiliser un échantillon frais.
#. speaker: CALLEA
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze103_03458:TEXT_LUCKZE103_03458_CALLEA_000_004:1"
msgid "Unfortunately, that's easier said than done. The most vital ingredient is a swab of the original poison with which the man was stricken. And furthermore, the medicine must be mixed immediately after obtaining the sample, while the venom is still fresh..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: この砦の方は皆、わたしにとても良くしてくれた方ばかり……<br>絶対に死なせるわけにはいきません。<br>幸い、必要な毒はこの付近に棲息する魔物から採取できます。
#. de: Die Leute hier in der Festung waren immer gut zu mir. Wenn ich einen von ihnen vor dem sicheren Tod retten kann, dann muss ich es versuchen!
#. fr: C'est l'occasion pour moi de remercier les gens du fort pour tout le soutien qu'ils m'ont apporté. Je dois absolument guérir cet homme avec ce sérum. Par chance, il y a des créatures qui possèdent ce venin tout près d'ici.
#. speaker: CALLEA
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze103_03458:TEXT_LUCKZE103_03458_CALLEA_000_005:1"
msgid "We know precisely which type of beast did it, and they are more than plentiful in these parts. We would not have to travel far to procure the poison, provided we had someone with the strength to fell the fiend..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>さん、お願いします！<br>毒の採取を手伝ってください！<br>わたしも同行し、その場で調合しますので！
#. de: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>, bitte hilf mir. Du musst das Gift beschaffen und ich mische sofort an Ort und Stelle das Serum.
#. fr: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>, j'ai besoin de votre aide<nbsp>! Je vous en prie, obtenez-m'en un échantillon<nbsp>! Je vais vous accompagner afin de pouvoir faire la préparation im<shy>mé<shy>dia<shy>te<shy>ment<nbsp>!
#. speaker: CALLEA
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze103_03458:TEXT_LUCKZE103_03458_CALLEA_000_006:1"
msgid "The soldiers here have been so kind to my father and me... I simply cannot let them down in their time of need! Oh, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>, I beg of you...will you help me!?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: オレも連れて行ってくれ！<br>これでも衛兵だ、魔物の退治なら……！
#. de: Dann komme ich auch mit. Ich bin schließlich Soldat, und gegen all das Getier da draußen könnt ihr Hilfe gebrauchen.
#. fr: Je viens moi aussi<nbsp>! En tant que garde, il est de mon devoir d'éliminer les créatures dangereuses<nbsp>!
#. speaker: NIELDEN
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze103_03458:TEXT_LUCKZE103_03458_NIELDEN_000_007:1"
msgid "Ye can count on ol' Nielden too, my girl! I'm no slouch in battle after all, or have ye forgotten?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: いいえ、ニールデンおじさんはここに残って、<br>患者の看病をお願いします。<br>痛み止めの薬を残しておきますから！
#. de: Nein, Nielden, lass nur. Bitte bleib du hier bei dem Vergifteten. Ich lasse dir ein starkes Schmerzmittel da, falls seine Qual unerträglich wird.
#. fr: Non, Nielden, je préférerais que tu restes ici pour veiller sur le blessé. J'ai laissé des potions pour atténuer ses douleurs près de son lit.
#. speaker: CALLEA
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze103_03458:TEXT_LUCKZE103_03458_CALLEA_000_008:1"
msgid "Thank you, Uncle Nielden...but no. You must stay here with our patient. Make sure that he has water to drink, and tell him that I will return shortly with the antidote."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……わかった、気を付けて行ってこいよ。
#. de: Also gut. Dann euch beiden viel Glück.
#. fr: D'accord... Mais fais bien attention à toi<nbsp>!
#. speaker: NIELDEN
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze103_03458:TEXT_LUCKZE103_03458_NIELDEN_000_009:1"
msgid "...Aye, I understand. Watch yerself out there, Callea."
msgstr ""

#. ja: では、<split " " 1><string $gs1></split>さん、出発しましょう！<br>「<sheet BNpcName 8502 0>」は、<br>砦を出て西に広がる森に棲息するはずです！
#. de: Brechen wir gleich auf. Im Wald westlich der Festung müssten wir <noun-de BNpcName 1 8502 1 4 1> finden können.
#. fr: Bien, ne perdons pas un instant de plus, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split><nbsp>!<br>Les créatures en question, <noun-fr BNpcName 1 8502 2 1>, vivent dans la forêt à l'ouest du fort. Allons-y<nbsp>!
#. speaker: CALLEA
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze103_03458:TEXT_LUCKZE103_03458_CALLEA_000_010:1"
msgid "All right, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>, we've no time to lose! The creatures we seek lurk in the woodlands just west of the fort. I will meet you there!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: この辺りに棲息している<sheet BNpcName 8502 0>から、<br>血清を作るために必要な「<sheet EventItem 2002667 0>」が採れるはずです。<br><sheet BNpcName 8502 0>を倒して、採取をお願いします。
#. de: Hier sieht man manchmal <noun-de BNpcName 5 8502 2 4 1>. Sobald eine dieser Kreaturen auftaucht, musst du sie überwältigen und dann <noun-de EventItem 2 2002667 1 4 1> auffangen.
#. fr: Les créatures que nous recherchons vivent par ici. Lorsque vous trouverez <noun-fr BNpcName 1 8502 2 1>, attaquez-les pour essayer de récupérer <noun-fr EventItem 1 2002667 1 1>, s'il vous plaît.
#. speaker: CALLEA
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze103_03458:TEXT_LUCKZE103_03458_CALLEA_000_020:1"
msgid "Here we are, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>. Do you see those ghastly living trees? These are the fiends that poisoned that poor soldier. Here is a phial you may use to collect the sample."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 毒はすぐに変質してしまうと、父の手記に書いてありました。<br>良い状態の「<sheet EventItem 2002667 0>」が採れなかったら、<br>別の<sheet BNpcName 8502 0>を倒して、採取してみてください。
#. de: Im Notizbuch meines Vaters stand, dass die Flüssigkeit an der Luft sofort zu oxidieren beginnt. Das Gift muss unbedingt in gutem Zustand sein. Wenn du bei <noun-de BNpcName 1 8502 1 3 1> nichts Brauchbares abzapfen kannst, versuch es beim nächsten!
#. fr: D'après les notes de mon père, c'est une substance très instable. Vous aurez donc pro<shy>ba<shy>ble<shy>ment besoin d'abattre plusieurs de ces créatures pour obtenir ce qu'il nous faut.
#. speaker: CALLEA
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze103_03458:TEXT_LUCKZE103_03458_CALLEA_100_021:1"
msgid "Father's records made it clear that the venom is quick to break down. If too much time passes, I will have to ask you to collect a fresh sample."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet EventItem 2002667 0>」を採ってきていただけたら、<br>この場で、すぐに血清の調合をはじめますね。<br>大変な作業だとは思いますが、どうか、よろしくお願いします！
#. de: Es sollte eine scharlachrote Flüssigkeit sein. Wenn du die hast, gib sie mir. Das Rezept für das Serum habe ich bei mir<nbsp>... Hoffentlich gelingt es gleich beim ersten Versuch.
#. fr: Lorsque vous aurez <noun-fr EventItem 2 2002667 1 1>, je vous prie de me l'apporter rapidement. Je préparerai le sérum im<shy>mé<shy>dia<shy>te<shy>ment. Je compte sur vous<nbsp>!
#. speaker: CALLEA
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze103_03458:TEXT_LUCKZE103_03458_CALLEA_000_021:1"
msgid "Also, be warned: these beasts are not likely to part with their poison willingly. Like as not, you will have to weaken them somewhat before they allow you to get close enough to do the deed. Be safe, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>! I will stand by here and prepare the rest of the ingredients."
msgstr ""

#. ja: この辺りに棲息している<sheet BNpcName 8502 0>を倒して、<br>「<sheet EventItem 2002667 0>」を採取してください。<br>大変な作業だとは思いますが、どうか、よろしくお願いします！
#. de: Hier sieht man manchmal <noun-de BNpcName 5 8502 2 4 1>. Sobald eine dieser Kreaturen auftaucht, musst du sie überwältigen und dann <noun-de EventItem 2 2002667 1 4 1> auffangen.
#. fr: Les créatures que nous recherchons vivent par ici. Lorsque vous trouverez <noun-fr BNpcName 1 8502 2 1>, attaquez-les pour essayer de récupérer <noun-fr EventItem 1 2002667 1 1>, s'il vous plaît. Lorsque ce sera fait, apportez-moi ça rapidement<nbsp>!
#. speaker: CALLEA
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze103_03458:TEXT_LUCKZE103_03458_CALLEA_000_022:1"
msgid "Have you procured the sample yet? You must hurry! A young man's life depends on it!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>さん、<br>毒は採れましたか……？
#. de: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>! Ich habe Kampfgeräusche gehört. Konntest du genügend von dem Gift beschaffen?
#. fr: Alors, avez-vous pu obtenir un peu de cette toxine<nbsp>?
#. speaker: CALLEA
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze103_03458:TEXT_LUCKZE103_03458_CALLEA_000_030:1"
msgid "<split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>! Is that what I think it is?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ああ、ありがとうございます！<br>これなら問題なく血清が作れそうです！
#. de: Ein Glück! Das müsste ausreichen! Ich mache mich gleich an die Arbeit.
#. fr: Oh, parfait<nbsp>! Avec ça, je devrais pouvoir préparer le sérum dont le blessé a besoin<nbsp>!
#. speaker: CALLEA
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKze103_03458:TEXT_LUCKZE103_03458_CALLEA_000_031:1"
msgid "Perfect! Yes, I do believe this is exactly what I need to mix up the antidote!"
msgstr ""
